ic\"><a href=\"/page/Sounding\" title=\"Sounding\">Sounding</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Sounding\" title=\"Sounding\">Sounding</a>:</b> On Harmful Spellcast: Do an additional 4 to 24 Sonic Damage.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Nearly_Complete\" title=\"Nearly Complete\">Nearly Complete: Spell Focus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Nearly_Complete\" title=\"Nearly Complete\">Nearly Complete: Spell Focus</a></b>: This item isn't quite finished, but it's only a step away from completion. Bring it to the forges on the upper floor of <a href=\"/page/Gravenhollow\" title=\"Gravenhollow\">Gravenhollow</a> and combine it with melted materials to restore this item to its full potential.</span></span><br />\n<ul><li>This item can be upgraded with one of the following:\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_Focus\" title=\"Spell Focus\"> Abjuration Focus +13</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup toolt